  "text": {
    "en": {
      "name": "Evil Dragon Cards - Earth Dragon",
      "effect": "Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from your hand) by revealing 3 EARTH monsters in your hand, including this card. You can reveal this card in your hand; add 1 \"Dragon Card\" card from your Deck to your hand, then discard 1 card. When your opponent activates a monster effect on the field (Quick Effect): You can negate that effect, then if a WATER monster is on the field, this card cannot be destroyed by battle or card effects this turn. You can only use each effect of \"Evil Dragon Cards - Earth Dragon\" once per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
